					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "iJB39J87Rqmr5iIGvXuhjA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "# Project Configuration\n\nA Catalyst project has a small configuration file. It gives the project a name and lets the project override toolkit defaults when it needs to.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "AKbJNTVCTvGDCssYKMOlhQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Default layout\n\n```text\nMyProject/\n  config/\n    bvc/\n      bvc_defaults\n```\n\nThe generated file starts with the project name active and the other defaults commented out.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "gtchyWu+RJioVLieyG2YXQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Project name\n\n```sh\n: \"${BVC_PROJECT_NAME:=MyProject}\"\n```\n\nThis is the one value every project should set. Other values can stay inherited until there is a reason to change them.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "gQDNRDwQROeF/EY6ugcX/w=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Layering\n\nConfiguration is layered from most specific to least specific:\n\n```text\n1. Environment variables\n2. Project config: ${BVC_CONF_DIR:-config}/bvc/bvc_defaults\n3. Toolkit config: <bvc repo>/config/bvc/bvc_defaults\n4. Hard-coded safety defaults\n```\n\nEach layer only fills values that are not already set. That is why defaults use this shape:\n\n```sh\n: \"${NAME:=value}\"\n```\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "RsGNUzPATI+/TEVUmVg/WQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## BVC_CONF_DIR\n\n`BVC_CONF_DIR` selects the project config directory only.\n\nIt does not move the toolkit config directory. The toolkit keeps its own config in the bvc repository.\n\nMost projects should use the default `config` directory. If a project wants a different directory, set `BVC_CONF_DIR` in the environment before running bvc.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "qhdYDMXhTq+5xk08t+6OLA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Keep config boring\n\nDo not copy values just because they exist. Leave inherited values alone until the project actually needs a different value.\n\nA small config file is easier to understand, easier to diff, and much less likely to become haunted.\n"
			}
		]
	},
